      "grader_score": 3,
      "grader_notes": "The agent opened with an unneeded question about the cancellation reason and left a stray \"Of course\" in the verification turn. It also said \"someone can call you back\" and asked what time worked, then ignored both the caller's number and preferred time without explaining that the callback goes to the number on file, not the caller's.",
      "reply_delay_p50_ms": 1550.708708964521,
      "reply_delay_p90_ms": 4559.061667008791,
