      "transcript": [
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks for calling Summit Air, this is the virtual assistant. How can I help?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "hi i need to cancel the heating appointment at six two oh bedford avenue one one two three five",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Sure, I can help with that. Before I cancel, could you tell me the reason?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "i don't want a technician coming by today i'd rather just cancel it",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Got it. I'll look up the account for that address first. Since this number isn't on the account, I'll need to check a few details before I cancel it. Of course. And just to confirm you're the person for the visit, could you tell me your name?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "joanne price",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks. And what's the name on the visit?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "i'm not sure what name is on it i just know it's at six two oh bedford avenue one one two three five can you check that",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I'm sorry, I can't read out the name on the visit. If you can give me the name of the person the account is under, I can try again. Otherwise, someone from our team can call you to sort it out. Which would you prefer?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "well i don't know whose name is on the account i rent a room there so it might be my landlord's can't you just cancel it for the address i'd rather not have to go back and forth on this",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I understand, and I can't share who the account is under. Since the visit is under an account I can't verify from this number, the quickest route is for someone from our team to call you back and take care of the cancellation. Would you like me to set that up?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "fine i guess why can't you cancel it right now i'm the one who's living there so it seems like it should be simple",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I hear you, and it does seem like it should be simple. I can't cancel it without confirming the account holder's name, and I don't have that yet. The fastest option is a callback from our team. Would you like me to set that up?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "yes go ahead and set up the callback call me back at two one two five five five oh one five three",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "What time today works best for someone to call you back?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "any time before the technician is due to arrive would be best so i don't have a visit to deal with today i don't know exactly when that is so as soon as possible please",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I've let our team know. Someone will call the number we have on file by 9:30 AM. Anything else?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "no that's all thanks goodbye",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks for calling Summit Air. Have a great rest of your day.",
          "said": null
        }
